rd appears first, then his face, grim.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Four hands go up.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Then three come down, pointing at Mateo.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "School bus. He killed the school bus.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}